Z||000000||Cooter||01-14-2000||07:45 PM||||Got my clutch master cylinder kit from Fiero Store today. Opened the box and the little plastic bag that holds the rubber pieces was tore open and the cup washer and O-ring that I need to fix my clutch with are missing! $30 for a kit and somebody else already has the parts. I went down to Advance and had them order the same wagner part for me. It will be here tomorrow for $20. I WILL NOT PAY THE FIERO STORE FOR THEIR PART!!!! I am not going to pay to ship it back either. This really sucks! ||||reg||1
